acceptance_criteria: "workspace_root and pm_root in the MergeInstallResult carry one documented canonical form for every resolution channel (explicit tracker path, PM_SOURCE_* env, cwd discovery), and the macOS and Windows nightly legs pass tests/unit/sdk/merge-safety.spec.ts without per-platform normalization in the spec"
parent: pm-ugqx
risk: medium
confidence: high
resolution: Canonicalized merge-install result coordinates across every SDK resolution channel and hardened native-path diagnostics/tests.
expected_result: "All merge-install resolution channels return one documented canonical workspace_root and pm_root identity on Linux, macOS, and Windows."
actual_result: "All resolution channels canonicalize both coordinates; focused merge/context tests, exact local coverage, and the full five-leg nightly matrix pass."
