  "2026-07-28T12:14:59.039Z","harness:codex","Cross-platform evidence from nightly run 30356894804: macOS exposed /var versus /private/var and Windows exposed 8.3 versus long-name spellings in one missed assertion. The spec now compares the explicit tracker result to filesystem realpath and asserts canonical pm_root too; the idempotent install test restores cwd in finally to prevent Windows EBUSY cleanup masking."
  "2026-07-28T12:30:37.236Z","harness:codex","Nightly evidence: run 30358494567 proved canonical merge-root behavior on macOS and all Ubuntu variants. Windows Node 24 reached the full test suite and identified platform-specific assertion/ENOENT classification gaps now being corrected; the item remains active until the complete matrix is green."
  "2026-07-28T12:32:51.598Z","harness:codex","Focused correction evidence: 27 context-integrity and merge-safety tests pass, followed by typecheck and the complete strict static-quality suite (100% docstrings, package boundary, SDK parity/surface, token budget, entrypoint cost, transport floor)."
  "2026-07-28T13:03:58.480Z","harness:codex","Acceptance evidence: Nightly Validation run 30361026722 is green at head 1c6e871d2 on Ubuntu Node 22/24/25, macOS Node 24, and Windows Node 24. MergeInstallResult now reports canonical workspace_root and pm_root across explicit tracker, protected source-coordinate, and cwd channels; native macOS/Windows identity comparisons pass without platform-specific product normalization."
